# MTT q79 Height-Four PGL3 Polydisk Hessian Integrand Source (A385I) v1

A385I consumes the full A385S exponential alignment box and all eight Frechet coordinate derivatives. In each selected line chart it evaluates the A378 Gauss-Manin reduction, moving right-frame derivative, covariant Hessian rows, and anchored normal-function forcing over the whole box.

The packet certifies `128` five-component covariant rows and `128` anchored forcing entries. Every box contains its independently fixed A378 center entry. No observed Standard Model value enters.

This closes the local polydisk source, not the moving initial cycles or the path integrals. Those are the remaining inputs to a whole-box residual Jacobian and Krawczyk certificate.
